OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,8,     GGrieg, Liszt and Szymanowska.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GChief Conductor Domingo Hindoyan
OL,11,     Gjoins the Royal Liverpool
OL,12,     GPhilharmonic in a performance of
OL,13,     GMahler's Symphony No. 9.
OL,14,G2145FBetween the Ears: Miniatures
OL,15,     F(Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,16,     GIn Night Chorus, a night walk
OL,17,     Gthrough an Illinois marsh reveals
OL,18,     Gthe bigness of small things.
