OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto is back with more of the
OL,12,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,13,     Garound the world, and Nduduzo
OL,14,     GMakhathini spotlights another
OL,15,     Galbum for his selection.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GUkraine-born Vadym Kholodenko
OL,18,     Gplays Rachmaninov's second piano
OL,19,     Gconcerto with the BBC National
OL,20,     GOrchestra of Wales. The programme
OL,21,     Gstarts with Bacewicz's Concerto
OL,22,     Gfor String Orchestra.
